
# IPF DIFFERENTIAL EXPRESSION ANALYSIS
# Pipeline 2 — IPF dataset
#
# 3 Contrasts:
#   1. Baseline   : day7_DMSO - day0_SF (just for ref)
#   2. Nintedanib : day7_Nin  - day7_DMSO 
#   3. Senicapoc  : day7_Senic - day7_DMSO
#
# FDR threshold: < 0.1
# Fold-change threshold: |log2FC| > 0.58

#########################################
#STEP 0 SET UP

# 1. PACKAGES & SETUP

